            </div> <!-- cd-faq-content -->
        </li>
		<li>
            <a class="cd-faq-trigger" href="#0">PLAYER OF THE MATCH (POTM) POINTS</a>
            <div class="cd-faq-content">
                <p>60 pts if POTM is your Captain (C)</p>
                <p>40 pts if POTM is your Vice Captain (VC)</p>
				<p>30 pts if POTM is in your team but neither as C or VC</p>
                <p>Note: As per existing rules, points form C(i.e. 2x)/VC (i.e. 1.5x) and PowerPlays will be added on top of the above base points.</p>
            </div> 
        </li>
